'''Gluttony''' is a [[unique]] {{il|Leather Belt}}.

==Mechanics==
* [[Culling strike|Culling strikes]] kill enemies that would have had 10% of health left after receiving damage from the hit.
* {{c|mod|Take (100-200) Physical Damage when you use a Movement Skill}}: the [[self-damage]] counts as a hit of [[Secondary damage]], and does count for effects that trigger 'when hit' or 'when you take damage from hits', however this damage cannot be [[Block|blocked]], [[Spell suppression|suppressed]], or [[Dodge|dodged]] or cause [[stun]].


{{Item acquisition}}

==Legacy variants==
Gluttony has a [[legacy variant]].

{{legacy variant table header}}
{{legacy variant table row|3.12.0|+(25-40) to maximum Life|
* {{c|mod|Trigger Level 30 Poacher's Mark when you hit a Rare or Unique Enemy}}
* +(60-80) to maximum Life
* {{c|mod|Culling Strike against Enemies Cursed with Poacher's Mark}}
* Take (100-200) Physical Damage when you use a Movement Skill
* You have no Armour or Maximum Energy Shield
}}
{{Legacy variant table end}}

